  "notable_quotes": [
    "An eco-friendly ambient-pressure route using inexpensive chemicals produced kg-scale MIL-120(Al)-AP with crystallinity and porosity comparable to hydrothermal MIL-120(Al)-HP.",
    "Shaped millimeter-sized MIL-120(Al)-AP beads with inorganic binders showed efficient CO2/N2 separation in breakthrough tests, supporting industrial integration potential.",
    "Unlike hydrothermal MIL-120(Al)-HP, the AP form undergoes a monoclinic-to-triclinic transition on activation, retaining ~35-40% trapped water that aids CO2 binding."
  ],
